2	// A hand-authored 2D Canvas pinball table: plunger launch, two real rotating
3	// flippers, pop bumpers, glowing scoring rings, and three groups of drop
4	// targets that raise the multiplier. Three balls, multiball and extra balls.
5	// Vanilla ES modules, fixed-step 60 Hz loop, procedural art, synthesized
